	["EldoUI's own toasts for achievements, level-up, quest complete and more. Blizzard's version of each type you tick is hidden."] = "EldoUI's egne pop op-beskeder for achievements, level-up, fuldførte quests og mere. Blizzards udgave af hver type du sætter flueben ved, skjules.",
